<item><title>DStv unveils five lower-priced packages in Botswana</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/dstv-unveils-five-lower-priced-packages-in-botswana-2eba5a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/dstv-unveils-five-lower-priced-packages-in-botswana-2eba5a/</guid><category>Botswana</category><description>The redesign, its first in 30 years, adds dedicated sports and film options, and the Starter package now offers more than 85 channels.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:55:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" length="34363" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Botswana law gives consumers a stop to AI-driven direct marketing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-law-gives-consumers-a-stop-to-ai-driven-direct-2961b7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-law-gives-consumers-a-stop-to-ai-driven-direct-2961b7/</guid><category>Botswana</category><description>The Data Protection Act lets people object at any time to using their personal data for direct marketing, including related profiling.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:41:13 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" length="34363" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Botswana businesses face 72-hour data breach reporting window</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-businesses-face-72-hour-data-breach-reporting-e99abc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-businesses-face-72-hour-data-breach-reporting-e99abc/</guid><category>Botswana</category><description>Under the Data Protection Act, controllers must alert the commission without undue delay, and high-risk breaches also require notice to affected people.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:10:14 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-businesses-face-72-hour-data-breach-reporting-e99abc/share.jpg" length="42475" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-businesses-face-72-hour-data-breach-reporting-e99abc/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
